<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23795" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεισῐδαίμ-ων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείδω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>fearing the gods,</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> in good sense, <i>pious,
				religious,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.3.58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ages.</u>
				11.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. εἶναι καὶ φροντίζειν τῶν θεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1315a1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλος θνητοῖς εἴς τ᾽ ἀθανάτους δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1683
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					17.22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in bad sense,
				<i>superstitious,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				105
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. διάθεσις,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεισιδαιμονία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.62
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					2.132
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Pr.Im.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όνως</span> Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				129
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.195
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				27
			</span></i>.</div>
